1452→### volumesmoothsample
1453→
1454→```vex
1455→vector P    = {1.0, 2.0, 3.0};
1456→vector grad;
1457→matrix3 hess;
1458→
1459→float val1 = volumesmoothsample(0, "density", P, grad, hess);
1460→vector u   = {0.1, 0.01, 0.001};
1461→float val2 = volumesmoothsample(0, "density", P + u);
1462→
1463→// Taylor expansion: val1 + dot(u, grad) ≈ val2
1464→// Second order:     val1 + dot(u, grad) + 0.5 * dot(u, u*hess) ≈ val2
1465→```
